# Migration SQL bytes are hashed: the engine records a checksum per applied
# migration and refuses to run when a file changes. A checkout that rewrites
# line endings (core.autocrlf=true on Windows) would therefore change every
# checksum and make both `migrate up` and TestEmbeddedMigrationsMatchGoldenChecksums
# fail for reasons that have nothing to do with the migration itself.
#
# Pin these to LF so the bytes are identical on every platform.
internal/platform/migrate/sql/mysql/*.sql text eol=lf
internal/platform/migrate/checksums.golden text eol=lf
